{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09159","headline":"自尚书郎出爲滁州刺史 · 韦应物","name":"自尚书郎出爲滁州刺史","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"少年不远仕，秉笏东西京。\n中岁守淮郡，奉命乃征行。\n素慙省阁姿，况忝符竹荣。\n効愚方此始，顾私岂获幷。\n徘徊亲交恋，怆悢昆友情。\n日暮风雪起，我去子还城。\n登涂建隼旟，勒驾望承明。\n云台焕中天，龙阙郁上征。\n晨兴奉早朝，玉露沾华缨。\n一朝从此去，服膺理庶甿。\n皇恩傥岁月，归服厕羣英。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09159.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09159","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}